Star 12 is a stop on [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/the Horizon/index|the Horizon]] at the starward end of [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/index|Hallia]], and the neighborhood that grew up around it. The buildings went up when the tram line was first laid, in the belief that the city would expand this way, and the boom never came. They are older and less kept than those nearer the center, and the station is dirty and unrepaired. [[Org/The Undertable/index|The Undertable]], a pawn shop, sits here.
